=== bogus PLOYZ_TOKEN: status :: $ ployz status
error: Cloud refused PLOYZ_TOKEN: it is unknown, revoked or expired, its maker left its Organization, or its Organization was deleted
next: unset PLOYZ_TOKEN && ployz login

